 can you check? Try it before you read on."]}, {"k": "recall", "t": "Taking away tens", "p": ["60 − 20 = 40."], "qq": {"id": "m3u02s2t01", "type": "num", "prompt": "58 − 23?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "answer": 35, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": "35."}}, {"k": "idea", "t": "Subtracting by partitioning", "p": ["Take away the hundreds, then the tens, then the ones: 365 − 142 → 365 − 100 = 265 → 265 − 40 = 225 → 225 − 2 = **223**.", "Or count on from the smaller number: 142 → 200 (58) → 365 (165): 58 + 165 = 223."]}, {"k": "idea", "t": "Checking with addition", "p": ["Addition **undoes** subtraction. Check: 223 + 142 = 365 ✓."], "table": {"head": ["Subtraction", "Check"], "rows": [["365 − 142 = 223", "223 + 142 = 365"], ["80 − 35 = 45", "45 + 35 = 80"]]}}, {"k": "try", "t": "Subtract", "p": [], "qq": {"id": "m3u02s2t02", "type": "num", "prompt": "487 − 263?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "answer": 224, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": "224."}}, {"k": "method", "t": "How do I subtract?", "p": ["Step 1: Estimate first.", "Step 2: Take away hundreds, tens, ones (or count on).", "Step 3: Write the answer.", "Step 4: Check by adding."]}, {"k": "example", "t": "Partition", "p": [], "q": "576 − 234.", "steps": [["576 − 200 = 376", ""], ["376 − 30 = 346", ""], ["346 − 4", ""]], "a": "342"}, {"k": "example", "t": "Count on", "p": [], "q": "61 − 47.", "steps": [["47 → 50 = 3", ""], ["50 → 61 = 11", ""]], "a": "14"}, {"k": "example", "t": "Near a ten", "p": [], "q": "83 − 29.", "steps": [["83 − 30 = 53", ""], ["+ 1", ""]], "a": "54"}, {"k": "example", "t": "Check", "p": [], "q": "Is 92 − 37 = 55?", "steps": [["55 + 37 = 92 ✓", ""]], "a": "yes"}, {"k": "try", "t": "Count on", "p": [], "qq": {"id": "m3u02s2t03", "type": "num", "prompt": "72 − 68?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "answer": 4, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": "4."}}, {"k": "error", "t": "Subtracting the wrong way round", "p": ["Find the first wrong line."], "q": "52 − 18", "lines": ["ones: 8 − 2 = 6", "50 − 10 = 40", "46"], "bad": 0, "why": "You can't swap: count on 18 → 20 → 52 = 2 + 32 = 34.", "fix": [["34", ""]], "id": "m3u02s2t04"}, {"k": "mistake", "t": "Swapping digits to make it easy", "p": ["Count on or exchange – never swap."]}, {"k": "tip", "t": "Real life", "p": ["Working out how many are left, or how many more are needed."]}, {"k": "summary", "t": "What to remember", "p": ["Take away by place value or count on.", "Near a ten: round and adjust.", "Check with addition."]}], "video": {"src": null, "offset": 0, "dur": 660, "range": ""}, "stops": [{"id": "2.2-k1", "t": 1, "after": 0, "review": [0, 0], "note": "", "q": {"id": "m3u02s2k01", "type": "num", "prompt": "Before you read on: books left?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "answer": 223, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": ""}}, {"id": "2.2-k2", "t": 2, "after": 4, "review": [0, 0], "note": "", "q": {"id": "m3u02s2k02", "type": "num", "prompt": "223 + 142?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "answer": 365, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": ""}}, {"id": "2.2-k3", "t": 3, "after": 9, "review": [0, 0], "note": "", "q": {"id": "m3u02s2k03", "type": "num", "prompt": "61 − 47?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "answer": 14, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": ""}}, {"id": "2.2-k4", "t": 4, "after": 14, "review": [0, 0], "note": "", "q": {"id": "m3u02s2k04", "type": "num", "prompt": "Quick check: 52 − 18?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "answer": 34, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": ""}}], "captions": [], "chapters": [[0,